        "title": {
          "en": "OpenAI Introduces AI ROI Scorecard",
          "zh": "OpenAI推出AI投资回报率记分卡"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI CFO Sarah Friar introduced a practical AI scorecard designed to measure return on investment by evaluating useful work, cost per successful task, dependability, and return on compute.",
          "zh": "OpenAI首席财务官Sarah Friar推出了一款实用的AI记分卡，旨在通过评估有效工作、每项成功任务的成本、可靠性和计算回报来衡量投资回报率。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The scorecard measures \"useful work\" generated by AI implementations.",
            "It quantifies the \"cost per successful task\" for AI agents.",
            "It assesses \"dependability\" and \"return on compute\" for AI systems."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "该记分卡衡量AI实施产生的“有效工作”。",
            "它量化了AI代理“每项成功任务的成本”。",
            "它评估AI系统的“可靠性”和“计算回报。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This scorecard provides a standardized framework for organizations to quantitatively assess the value and efficiency of their AI investments, addressing a key challenge in AI adoption. By offering clear metrics, it facilitates data-driven decision-making and optimization of AI strategies.",
          "zh": "该记分卡为组织提供了一个标准化框架，以量化评估其AI投资的价值和效率，解决了AI采用中的一个关键挑战。通过提供清晰的指标，它有助于数据驱动的决策和AI战略的优化。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
        "link": "https://openai.com/index/a-scorecard-for-the-ai-age"
      },
