            "Architectural innovations contributing to this include KV Sharing.",
            "Further developments mentioned are mHC and Compressed Attention."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Gemma 4和DeepSeek V4等新型开源大语言模型正在降低长上下文相关的成本。",
            "为此贡献的架构创新包括KV共享。",
            "提及的其他发展有mHC和压缩注意力。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "These architectural improvements in LLMs address the challenge of scaling AI use cases by making long-context processing more cost-effective, which can influence future investment decisions for IT leaders.",
          "zh": "这些LLM架构的改进通过提高长上下文处理的成本效益，解决了扩展AI用例的挑战，这可能影响IT领导者未来的投资决策。"
        },
